{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>And a man who commits adultery.</b> It goes back over all the forbidden relations in the section of Aḥarei and specifies their laws here — most of them explicitly and some by gezerah shavah, except for the relations of a woman to her sister." "<b>They shall surely be put to death, the adulterer and the adulteress.</b> The punishment we have heard. From where do we know the warning? Scripture says: לא תנאף."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:13:45.055027657Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}